{"sections":[{"slug":"分次代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"分次代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">分次代数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"分次代数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">分次代数是分成不同次数的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">齐次</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">部分之和的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">齐次元素的乘积的次数是次数的和</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">次数也可取值于一般的幺半群</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定基环</span> $k$, <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半群</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">通常</span> $M = \\mathbb{Z}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $M$-<span lang=\"zh\">分次代数为</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">带有底层</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的分解</span>\n$$\r\nA = \\bigoplus_{m\\in M} A_m,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $A_m$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素称为</span> $m$ <span lang=\"zh\">次的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">齐次元素</span></strong>,\n<span lang=\"zh\">满足齐次元素的乘积仍为齐次元素</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即乘法映射将</span> $A_m \\times A_{m'}$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $A_{mm'}$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">余模结构</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为交换幺半群</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">回忆幺半群代数</span> $k[M]$ <span lang=\"zh\">的双代数结构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">注意到自由</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">模函子</span>\n$$\r\nk[-]\\colon (\\mathsf{Set},\\times) \\to (\\mathsf{Mod}(k),\\otimes)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为对称幺半函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">故将</span> $(\\mathsf{Set},\\times)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的交换余交换</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/双代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">双代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应到</span> $\\mathsf{Mod}(k)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的交换余交换双代数</span> $k[M]$, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $\\mathsf{CAlg}(k)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的余交换</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合余代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">现在</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">容易验证</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $M$-<span lang=\"zh\">分次结构等同于</span> $\\mathsf{CAlg}(k)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的余代数</span> $k[M]$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个余模结构</span>\n$$\r\nA \\to A[M] := A \\otimes_k k[M],\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $m$ <span lang=\"zh\">次齐次元素</span> $a$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $a \\otimes m$. <span lang=\"zh\">其构成代数同态的条件恰好表明齐次元素的乘积的次数是各自次数的和</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">地</span>, $\\operatorname{Spec}k[M]$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴中的交换幺半群</span>, $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $M$-<span lang=\"zh\">分次也等同于</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}k[M]$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/群作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">作用</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}